      "duration": 3.504,
      "start": 17.052,
      "end": 20.556,
      "scene": "scene-03"
    },
    {
      "id": "cap07",
      "text": "CoreWeave营收增长一倍，积压订单约一千零四十亿美元；",
      "path": "assets/audio/segments/cap07.mp3",
      "duration": 4.992,
      "start": 20.616,
      "end": 25.608,
      "scene": "scene-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "cap08",
      "text": "超微电脑毛利率升到十七点五，年度收入指引最高七百二十亿美元。",
      "path": "assets/audio/segments/cap08.mp3",
      "duration": 6.216,
      "start": 25.668,
      "end": 31.884,
      "scene": "scene-04"
    },
    {
